  "$comment": [
    "Rem-family names a public skill may state verbatim — the allowlist behind the",
    "Rem-family name check in lint-skills.mjs (rem-public-skill-generalization §3.2).",
    "Every entry needs a publicly verifiable source. Verify ANONYMOUSLY, because a stored",
    "credential silently resolves a private repository:",
    "  git -c credential.helper= -c core.askPass= ls-remote --heads <repo>",
    "A name that fails that check is generalized, or moved to a RemSkillsPrivate companion skill.",
    "The check matches RemXxx plus the type-prefixed URemXxx/ERemXxx forms; both resolve to the",
    "bare entry here. Names that merely read like Rem (remote, RemoveAtSwap, the engine's",
    "RemapTimes) never match and need no entry.",
    "documentedExamples is for names that are illustrative rather than project facts —",
    "placeholders (rem-write-better-skill §3) and engine types. They are still decisions, so",
    "they carry a source too."
  ],
